nfection cohort divided by the incidences\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"RRs whose CIs did not include 1.0 were considered statistically significant\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"RRs were not compared across outcomes, risk windows, vaccine dose, or sex and age stratum.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The sex- and age-stratified incidences of the cardiac outcomes (cases per 100,000 persons) were calculated within 7-, 21-, or 42-day risk windows.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"data were obtained using a query that returned aggregate data from sites, precluding adjustment for potential confounders\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}